* ''A Kahu seat per tier'' (operator, 2026-11-12, the same approval). Each tier seats its own Kahu quorum; any human may hold seats at several tiers, and no tier's seats count toward another tier's quorum (<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/kahu#/seats-per-tier`>>).

